---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';

const sections = [
  {
    heading: 'Using Decorna',
    body: [
      `Decorna is an app by <strong>Muhammad Asad</strong> that creates AI redesigns of spaces from your photos. By using it you agree to these terms.
       Apple's standard Licensed Application End User License Agreement also applies, and where the two differ, Apple's governs the app licence itself.`,
      `Use it only with photos you own or have the right to use, and not to create anything unlawful, deceptive or harmful. I may limit or end access for misuse.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Credits, plans and purchases',
    body: [
      `New users get 3 free credits. One redesign uses one credit. <strong>Decorna Pro</strong> is a subscription (weekly, monthly or yearly) that adds credits each period,
       removes the watermark on saved and shared images, and unlocks extras such as alternate app icons. Credit packs can be bought separately.`,
      `Purchases are made through your Apple Account and billed by Apple. Subscriptions renew automatically until you cancel at least 24 hours before the end of the period.
       Manage or cancel them in iOS Settings, your name, Subscriptions. Refunds are handled by Apple under its own policy.`,
      `Unused credits from a period do not carry over unless the app says they do. If a redesign fails on my side, the credit is returned.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'About the results',
    body: [
      `Redesigns are produced by AI. They can be inaccurate, can differ from the real space, and are not architectural, structural or safety advice.
       Check anything that matters, such as measurements or load-bearing changes, with a qualified professional before acting on it.`,
      `You keep ownership of your photos. You may use the redesigns you create for your own purposes, including commercial ones, subject to the law and to these terms.
       I do not guarantee that a result is unique, since similar inputs can produce similar images.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Your account',
    body: [
      `You are responsible for your sign-in details and for activity on your account. You can delete your account any time from Profile, Account, Delete Account.
       How your data is handled is explained in the <a href="/decorna/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Availability and changes',
    body: [
      `Decorna depends on third-party services and may be unavailable, slow or changed without notice. I may update the app, its features and these terms.
       Continuing to use the app after a change means you accept it.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Liability',
    body: [
      `Decorna is provided as is. To the extent the law allows, I am not liable for indirect or consequential loss, or for decisions you make based on a redesign.
       Nothing here limits rights you have under consumer law that cannot be limited.`,
    ],
  },
  {
    heading: 'Contact',
    body: [
      `Write to <a href="mailto:m.asad.chatthaa@gmail.com">m.asad.chatthaa@gmail.com</a> or use Profile, Support &amp; Feedback in the app.`,
    ],
  },
];
---

<Legal
  title="Decorna Terms of Service"
  description="The terms for using Decorna: credits, subscriptions, AI results and your account."
  path="/decorna/terms/"
  h1="Terms of Service"
  meta="Last updated 11 October 2026"
  intro="The short version: use your own photos, treat the redesigns as inspiration, and Apple handles the billing."
  sections={sections}
/>
